  "description": "QATKUU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H120 Fe4 N8 O36 Y4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 4 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 4 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 4 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.379-3.840 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.21-143.36°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H126Fe4N10O36Y4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 Piv (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
